  "body": "It is often difficult to determine where the current head of the path is for a given Canvas/Path2D.  This is especially true for `arc`/`arcTo`/`ellipse`.  I am proposing that readonly attributes be added to `CanvasPath` that expose the current point.\r\n\r\n```webidl\r\nreadonly attribute float currentX;\r\nreadonly attribute float currentY;\r\n```",
